OL,3,GNEWSASafety first in removal of
OL,4,A'deteriorating' bridges
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo deteriorating motorway footbridges
OL,7,Fare due to be demolished for safety
OL,8,Freasons, National Highways has said.
OL,10,FThe M5 will be closed in both
OL,11,Fdirections between junctions 11 and 12
OL,12,Ffrom 23:00 BST on Friday until 06:00 on
OL,13,FMonday so the Grove Court and Uphill
OL,14,FCourt bridges can be removed.
OL,16,FTerry Robinson, south west engineering
OL,17,Flead for National Highways, said the
OL,18,Fbridges needed to be "removed now for
OL,19,Fpublic safety", adding "[The bridges]
OL,20,Fwon't go another winter without serious
OL,21,Fdeterioration."
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
