OL,3,GNEWSASafety first in removal of
OL,4,A'deteriorating' bridges
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe M5 northbound junction 11a exit
OL,7,Fslip road is currently closed for
OL,8,Fstorage of equipment and plant vehicles
OL,9,Fallowing for faster access and ensuring
OL,10,Fthe road closure does not have to be
OL,11,Fextended.
